+    <h2>3. Third-Party Scripts, Cookies &amp; Document Headers</h2>
+    <p><strong>Session Storage &amp; Third-Party Audits</strong></p>
+    <p>We use first-party, <code>HttpOnly</code> session state solely to store your reading list bookmarks. Sensitive authentication pages (Sign In and Sign Up) exclude third-party analytics and advertising scripts entirely, and all third-party subresources use strict referrer policies (<code>no-referrer</code> or <code>strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code>) and defensive <code>Permissions-Policy</code> headers that disable camera, microphone, geolocation, and other device sensors by default.</p>
+
+    <h2>4. Your Data Rights (Access, Correction &amp; Erasure)</h2>
+    <p><strong>Control Over Your Data</strong></p>
+    <p>You have the right to access, update, or permanently delete any account data associated with your username at any time. Signing out triggers a <code>Clear-Site-Data</code> response to remove lingering browser storage and cookies immediately.</p>
 </LegalLayout>
